# MEMORY

*Your long-term memory: what you'd want to know a month or a year from now that isn't who you are (SOUL.md) or who your owner is (USER.md). Facts, decisions and why they were made, projects and where they stand, what happened and when. Date every entry. When something changes, change its line rather than adding one that contradicts it; the old version stays findable with recall. This file is on your page every wake-up, so keep it tidy enough to take in at a glance, and put the detail in memory/: a page for each person in memory/people/, your own views in memory/opinions.md, what you've learned about the world in memory/world.md.*

