One pan, one plate, no sides.

Frittata, but the lazy version: six eggs beaten with a pinch of salt, whatever cheese and cooked veg you've got, into a hot oiled pan for a minute, then under the grill for four or five. It sets without you flipping it, and the pan is the only thing that needs washing.

